<title>NEW ZEALAND: TABLE-NZ ADRS MIXED AS WALL STREET BACKTRACKS.</title>
<headline>TABLE-NZ ADRS MIXED AS WALL STREET BACKTRACKS.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand ADRs were mixed</p>
<p>after a broad reversal in the DJI and on the Nasaq exchange.</p>
<p>Price movements of NZ stocks listed in the U.S. and</p>
<p>Australia.</p>
<p>Company	  Exchange    Last	  Net change</p>
<p>FCL Bldg	 N.Y.    US$27/15	 -0/01</p>
<p>FCL Engy	 N.Y.    US$34/11	 +0/07</p>
<p>FCL Paper	N.Y.    US$22/0118     +0/07</p>
<p>FCL Forest     N.Y.    US$12/11	 unch</p>
<p>MAS Tech	 NASDAQ  US$22 5/8	unch</p>
<p>Telecom	  N.Y.    US$38 7/8	-0 1/8</p>
<p>Tranz Rail     N.Y.    US$16 3/8	-0/05</p>
<p>Lion	    Sydney  A$3.50	   -4</p>
<p>Goodman	 Sydney  A$2.01	   -5</p>
<p>Macraes	 Sydney  A$1.12	   -1</p>
<p>Notes - In New York, Telecom's American Depository Receipts are traded in bundles of eight shares, while both the Fletcher Challenge shares are in bundles of 10 each. Tranz Rail ADSs are groups of three ordinary shares.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
